[{"title":"官舍庭前古梅寻常开拶岁暮余整归装而乃蚤花不容自默","author":"徐集孙","text":"狰狞古怪虬龙枝，著花传舍宾岁晚。\n往往来来几番人，老大相期疑未谖。\n顾我冷眼惯相看，嗅花嚼蕊当餐饭。\n横斜峭拔耐雪霜，肯媚阳和齐婉娩。\n把酒邀月共说诗，疏影上衣成缱绻。\n朔风吹梦入家山，鼓舞倦矣客兮返。\n谁谓花先常岁期，澈夜万葩玉一本。\n花应有心饯我行，吐芳非为冬日煖。\n我亦逆知此花意，孤洁难与俗人混。\n似嫌托根富贵场，不若栖身山林稳。\n惜乎花只不能言，一花一心诚恳恳。\n任它世间竞酣桃李春，花独与我结交岁寒远。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54067,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采莲曲 其一","author":"俞桂","text":"朝露湿妾衣，暮霞耀妾瞩。\n一叶小如瓜，去住无拘束。\n兀棹歌采菱，袭袭薰风足。\n芦叶映港清，捉对鸳鸯浴。\n莲中有苦心，欲折手还曲。\n折莲恐伤藕，藕断丝难续。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54068,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金沙井","author":"徐集孙","text":"修绠垂瓶自汲深，水澄沙瑩几星金。\n分明不与贪泉比，莫为金沙起利心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54069,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中用进退格","author":"徐集孙","text":"秋来天气半晴阴，块坐山窗一欠伸。\n欲睡却思妨官业，怕吟惟恐动乡心。\n远书难准衣仍薄，清俸无多橐惯贫。\n个种关情畦稻熟，雨宜时降不宜霪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54070,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"促刺词","author":"徐集孙","text":"促刺复促刺，劝织声转剧。\n小妇跣雨采桑归，大姑煮雪抽丝绎。\n辛勤欲织禦寒衣，朝暮惟恐不盈尺。\n织成门外迫催租，不了输租仍卖绤。\n妇姑对泣儿号寒，更无可补儿衣隙。\n帛暖本拟代绤寒，卖绤寒来愈无策。\n促刺兮，促刺兮，劝人织兮织何益。\n贮之金屋是何人，重重绫锦饰珠璧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54071,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋风悲","author":"徐集孙","text":"秋风悲，秋风悲，秋风悲兮落叶飞。\n豪家不识秋风悲，杯酒暖热儿女嬉。\n秋风悲，秋风悲，秋风悲兮陇穗萎。\n田舍不识秋风悲，腰镰收刈鸡豚肥。\n秋风悲，秋风悲，秋风悲兮塞角吹。\n戍人不识秋风悲，只愿封侯不顾死，枣红十载忘归期。\n秋风悲，秋风悲，秋风最可悲兮。\n江流滔滔，禾黍离离，为此悲者其知谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54072,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋胡行","author":"徐集孙","text":"五年行迈兮归迟迟，采桑山阴兮奉亲慈。\n冰霜自洁兮清节持，有客遗金兮志不移。\n橐有金兮盍专为母驰，心悦桑女下车兮人可知。\n庭中见妾兮徒忸怩，载思往事兮妾心孔悲。\n君不如妾之有节兮言姑已而，君不知孝兮世道衰，妾不死兮欲何为。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54073,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄诗僧","author":"徐集孙","text":"昔日剡溪曾载雪，君今访我以晴期。\n一庭梅雨何时竟，吟得诗来举似谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54074,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菊","author":"徐集孙","text":"寂寂东篱姿，凄彼霜露湿。\n不肯出春风，俗眼岂相入。\n世无陶靖节，此趣谁收拾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54075,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢偃溪惠索淘","author":"徐集孙","text":"与客敲诗倚古松，乱蝉声里夕阳舂。\n几年饭颗山头瘦，槐叶今朝得饱供。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54076,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"落梅","author":"徐集孙","text":"春雨敲花逐水流，游蜂催课未知休。\n生来独冷嫌无雪，别去相逢又隔秋。\n紫蒂窠窠凝酒恨，苍苔点点落诗愁。\n黄昏未觉师雄梦，塞管一声何处楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54077,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"徐集孙","text":"莫言满眼无知己，耐久黄花是故人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54078,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"哭朱龟岩","author":"徐鼎","text":"掩涕愁相向，风凄日满篱。\n旧交无一在，哭子有馀悲。\n暗竹扃书牖，孤灯上蕙帷。\n寡妻惟抱子，具说病来时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54079,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝命诗","author":"徐崧","text":"成仁取义在于斯，一死君恩报未迟。\n杲日当空存正气，狂澜砥柱起常彝。\n孔明未复中原鼎，鹏举空搴二帝旂。\n可恨奸回移宋祚，阖门厉鬼泣秦师。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54080,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瀫波亭 其二","author":"徐慥","text":"古县幽亭胜景多，青春啼鸟每相过。\n林间石磬风敲竹，水面金蛇日漾波。\n得友且须频载酒，爱山何必更扪萝。\n我来欲作无何醉，为子敲盘试一歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54081,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瀫波亭 其一","author":"徐慥","text":"瀫波亭下晚维舟，缥缈烟屏翠欲流。\n忽地惊雷过溪面，连天吹雪下山头。\n汀洲瑟缩藏鸥鹭，涯涘瀰漫失马牛。\n自笑劳生日苍鬓，不知来往竟何求。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54082,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壬寅仲秋二十有五日哭东莱先生之墓 其一","author":"徐暄","text":"缺月疏星夜己阑，风凄露重逼人寒。\n邮亭破晓经行处，不似今朝酷鼻酸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54083,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壬寅仲秋二十有五日哭东莱先生之墓 其三","author":"徐暄","text":"先生墓木已成阴，霁月光风何处寻。\n只有遗言常烱烱，誓将白首契初心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54084,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壬寅仲秋二十有五日哭东莱先生之墓 其四","author":"徐暄","text":"四海瞻依一伟人，丘封嶪嶪木森森。\n仰天恸哭悲风起，举世中和孰嗣音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54085,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壬寅仲秋二十有五日哭东莱先生之墓 其二","author":"徐暄","text":"庚子秋中忆请违，先生温语扣还期。\n去年匍匐双溪路，迨似当年失母时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54086,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题集福院","author":"徐楠","text":"松溪竹坞密藏村，行尽杉阴始到门。\n一鸟不啼春有思，千山都绿烧无痕。\n自惭俗吏尘埃久，来伴禅僧语笑温。\n瓶水炉香三十载，阅人此地几朝昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54087,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江上翁","author":"徐照","text":"江头老翁不为贫，自织笭箵张素鳞。\n明月江头春水涨，小船撑岸拾流薪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54088,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江南曲","author":"徐照","text":"络纬催寒断梦头，不眠双泪枕边流。\n屏风莫展江南画，寸地能生千里愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54089,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自君之出矣 其一","author":"徐照","text":"自君之出矣，心意远相随。\n拆破唐人绢，经经是双丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54090,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟上","author":"徐照","text":"小船停桨逐潮还，四五人家住一湾。\n贪看晓光侵月色，不知云气失前山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54091,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观所养鸂鶒","author":"徐照","text":"一身文采异常流，却使闲身不自由。\n永日翠笼相并睡，岂无魂梦到沧洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54092,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀赵紫芝翁灵舒","author":"徐照","text":"紫芝别我天台去，翁十深山自结茅。\n但见春愁随日长，不知庭叶蔽禽巢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54093,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李溪曲别郑遇","author":"徐照","text":"七十二滩声共闻，一朝路向李溪分。\n梅花无情动春梦，未好忆家先忆君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54094,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杜甫坟","author":"徐照","text":"耒阳知县非知己，救厄无踪岂忍闻。\n若更声名可埋没，行人定不吊空坟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54095,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和翁常之","author":"徐照","text":"八尺蕲州桃竹簟，坐来疑是水侵裳。\n垂杨叶下闲吟久，又与鸣蝉共晚凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54096,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采兰曲","author":"徐照","text":"门前春水青如罗，采兰船小长经过。\n未须折兰喜相赠，见此自令忧思多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54097,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采莲曲 其二","author":"徐照","text":"罗盖初收晚日阴，野凫飞起小鱼沉。\n莲蓬摘下留空柄，把向船前探水深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54098,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采莲曲 其一","author":"徐照","text":"行遍塘边不肯归，鸳鸯打起看双飞。\n荷花近岸难攀折，蒲苇丛深露湿衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54099,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其二","author":"徐照","text":"懒临妆架索朱绵，上得高台失宝钿。\n内屋深屏多画杏，有谁独喜画双莲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54100,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其一","author":"徐照","text":"睡眼蒙茸带宿酲，起来阶下探春晴。\n满身花露听莺久，禁鼓重新打六更。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54101,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫怨","author":"徐照","text":"杨柳枝疏见月痕，夜香烧了锁宫门。\n琵琶不有愁人听，谁识声中是怨言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54102,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昭君词","author":"徐照","text":"琵琶弹得是胡音，上马低蛾泪滴襟。\n画匠枉教延寿死，相如作赋得黄金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54103,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柳下闻蝉","author":"徐照","text":"晚凉多处听蝉声，齐女当年变化成。\n不合著身杨柳上，也令千古动离情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54104,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洪州城下作","author":"徐照","text":"野霭初收见远汀，数株杨柳是官亭。\n渔人向晚各归去，一阵风来钓具腥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54105,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"美人睡起曲","author":"徐照","text":"睡起胡蜂已退衙，袖中犹带郁金牙。\n懒拈青扇遮微雨，斗摘庭前紫笑花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54106,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻水","author":"徐照","text":"灯光难照客怀开，忽听寒声响似雷。\n天气无风树无叶，道州半夜水流来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54107,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"莫愁曲","author":"徐照","text":"莫愁石城住，今来无莫愁。\n只重石城水，曾汎莫愁舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54108,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"商人妇","author":"徐照","text":"百尺樯竿过酒楼，竹标雉尾信风头。\n高鬟粉项商人妇，不识人间离别愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54109,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄家书作","author":"徐照","text":"屋头桑叶大如钱，知是吴蚕第一眠。\n远水忽来潇岸没，家书却寄道州船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54110,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔者","author":"徐照","text":"瑟瑟风吹鬓发飞，自将莎草补蓑衣。\n小船撑入芦花去，家在溪边多不归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54111,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登宿觉庵","author":"徐照","text":"雨过山庵树色鲜，江城四月尚衣绵。\n本来行饭尝新茗，又得凭栏看插田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54112,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题张提举西墅","author":"徐照","text":"渡头风景如前日，谁种桃花在两边。\n未晚人家门户闭，鹭鸶闲立钓鱼船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54113,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题李半村晒蓑台","author":"徐照","text":"松枝宿雨碎滴下，野鹤巢边多水禽。\n不见蓑衣台上晒，来人自起钓鱼心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54114,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题赵运管吟篷","author":"徐照","text":"飞尘难到碧波中，波上烟云尽不同。\n吟断不知惊鹭起，汀花一半在船篷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54115,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题赵明叔新居","author":"徐照","text":"社坛侧近地图宽，所作园池亦在间。\n十万人家城里住，少闻人有对门山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54116,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"缲丝曲","author":"徐照","text":"荻箔争收茧，瓢轮斗卷丝。\n未充身上著，先卖给朝饥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54117,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入湘二首 其二","author":"徐照","text":"土若丹砂颜色赤，山无高势小成丛。\n江船未惯行湘水，越客新能下楚风。\n兰杜满汀过绿草，鸳鸯近日别轻鸿。\n地涂先识永陵郡，曾看邻翁画轴中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54118,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入湘二首 其一","author":"徐照","text":"入湘无浊水，天亦悯忠臣。\n阴结鱼龙气，香闻兰杜春。\n高吟方有思，静望忽伤神。\n舟上多渔父，应无似昔人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54119,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上封寺","author":"徐照","text":"步经千万歇，两日至山平。\n磬逐炉香尽，猿摇树雪倾。\n昔曾因画见，谁拟得吟行。\n又出穹林阁，终宵看日生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54120,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"子规","author":"徐照","text":"羽类是游魂，哀多属曙昏。\n一时亡国恨，千古向人言。\n山竹已应裂，野花犹更繁。\n昔曾令杜甫，再拜忆君尊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54121,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中即事","author":"徐照","text":"著履上崔嵬，呼儿注瓦杯。\n千岑经雨后，一雁带秋来。\n野艇乘潮发，山园逐主开。\n馀生落樵牧，开卷少尘埃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54122,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中寄翁卷","author":"徐照","text":"忽看春至复春还，门外烟云没野间。\n吟有好怀忘瘦苦，贫多难事坏清闲。\n柳花未散色全绿，杜宇乍啼声更蛮。\n闻道扫松溪雨后，梦随溪雨到岩关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54123,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"徐照","text":"拥衾多不寐，吟思被愁分。\n雪气冲帘入，鸿声带雨闻。\n儿饥因废学，亲没未营坟。\n何致贫如此，肝肠痛莫云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54124,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中夕","author":"徐照","text":"中夕独依依，闲行未掩扉。\n水边山出月，松上雨沾衣。\n棹响初如近，萤光渐欲稀。\n不甘尘内事，长与此心违。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54125,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆赵紫芝","author":"徐照","text":"一别一百日，无书直至今。\n几回成夜梦，犹自废秋吟。\n小雪衣犹绤，荒年米似金。\n知音人亦有，谁若尔知心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54126,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归来","author":"徐照","text":"归来长独坐，谁更伴吾行。\n不念为生拙，偏思得句清。\n园晴秋菜少，井涸夜泉生。\n爱听灯前雨，松声相杂鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54127,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"永州书怀","author":"徐照","text":"嗜茶疑是病，羸瘦见诗形。\n天断征鸿过，汀多香草青。\n兴高贫不觉，身远事皆经。\n归路当游岳，僧言极可听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54128,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"永州寄翁灵舒","author":"徐照","text":"古郡百蛮边，苍梧九点烟。\n去家疑万里，归计在明年。\n风顺眠听角，楼高望见船。\n筠州当半道，长得秀诗篇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54129,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白下","author":"徐照","text":"白下严州近，崎岖昔未经。\n年丰山米贱，溪涸石苔腥。\n一月无新句，千岑役瘦形。\n人家今畏虎，未晚户先扃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54130,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白石岩","author":"徐照","text":"一石入遥天，千峰叠在前。\n人行不到处，仙去未多年。\n窦暗云生像，檐斜日照泉。\n皇朝宣赐物，弟子尚相传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54131,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白岩僧舍","author":"徐照","text":"佳景多为寺，一房当翠微。\n炉香穿野霭，杉露滴僧衣。\n割蜜蜂喧牖，抛生鸟候扉。\n山深随兴味，斜日不须归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54132,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石门瀑布","author":"徐照","text":"一派从天落，曾经李白看。\n千年流不尽，六月地长寒。\n洒木喷微沫，冲崖激怒湍。\n人言深碧处，常有老龙蟠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54133,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石家洞口","author":"徐照","text":"数朵山如削，青烟起墓墟。\n圣朝惟大度，蛮党亦安居。\n练卒来呈箭，生儿遣读书。\n更须看榜示，一与省人如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54134,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会饮鲍史君池台","author":"徐照","text":"案上一琴书数卷，不须此地有笙歌。\n厌居市井观天小，喜到君家见月多。\n叶满地飞随步履，鹤于人熟听吟哦。\n明朝也向山中去，手把松枝养太和。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54135,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会宿赵紫芝宅","author":"徐照","text":"残烛照屏风，高堂暑气空。\n初旬长少月，半夜忽来鸿。\n旧集三年久，清吟四坐同。\n城楼杀更点，声在雨声中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54136,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"光武庙","author":"徐照","text":"帐闭炉烟聚，山龙帝者衣。\n真人元有道，社鬼忽无威。\n画剥金犹在，碑平字半非。\n鼓鸣村犬吠，祭罢数翁归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54137,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘明远会宿翁灵舒西斋","author":"徐照","text":"秋色侵肌骨，还将鬓色侵。\n自来难会宿，安得废清吟。\n竹露滋丛菊，邻钟觉曙禽。\n城中同此月，不起故山心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54138,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]